### F. `waitForPortFree` and `waitForSocket` -- Port/Socket Readiness
**File:** `/home/gperry/Documents/GitHub/KNIRV/KNIRV_NETWORK/packages/KNIRVSERVER/pkg/knirvagent/manager.go`

Polling for port availability (attempting `net.Listen` every 200ms):
```go
func waitForPortFree(port int, deadline time.Duration) bool {
    end := time.Now().Add(deadline)
    for time.Now().Before(end) {
        ln, err := net.Listen("tcp", fmt.Sprintf(":%d", port))
        if err == nil { ln.Close(); return true }
        time.Sleep(200 * time.Millisecond)
    }
    return false
}
```

Polling for Unix socket creation (checking `os.Stat` and `net.DialTimeout` every 100ms):
```go
func waitForSocket(socketPath string, deadline time.Duration) bool {
    end := time.Now().Add(deadline)
    for time.Now().Before(end) {
        if _, err := os.Stat(socketPath); err == nil {
            conn, err := net.DialTimeout("unix", socketPath, 100*time.Millisecond)
            if err == nil { conn.Close(); return true }
        }
        time.Sleep(100 * time.Millisecond)
    }
    return false
}
```

